WORKFLOW SCHEMAS (FEAT-138)
--------------------------

GitHub Actions schema: SchemaStore/schemastore, Apache-2.0, unmodified.
GitLab CI schema: gitlab-org/gitlab-foss, MIT Expat, unmodified.
Pinned source commits and original licence texts are included under
crates/spagitty-core/src/pipelines/schemas/. These are bundled data; the
offline validator never downloads a schema supplied by a repository.

jsonschema 0.19.1 (MIT) validates the bundled schemas, with HTTP/file
resolution features disabled. regex (MIT OR Apache-2.0) matches bounded
GitLab conditions. The build-generated dependency list includes their
transitive dependencies.

CORRESPONDING SOURCE
--------------------

